{
  "date": "2026-11-09",
  "category": "finance",
  "title_zh": "上海银行等三家银行成为利率定价自律的核心成员",
  "title_en": "Three banks including Bank of Shanghai become core members of the interest-rate pricing self-discipline mechanism",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "11月6日，中国货币网公布了今年的名单，名单上是参加市场利率定价自律机制的各家银行。这个机制由银行共同参加，银行要按照规则给存款和贷款定价。核心成员从去年的15家增加到了18家。",
      "en": "On November 6, China Money Network published this year's list, which names the banks taking part in the market interest-rate pricing self-discipline mechanism. Banks take part in this mechanism together, and they price deposits and loans according to its rules. Core members rose from 15 last year to 18."
    },
    {
      "zh": "新加入的三家是上海银行、杭州银行和宁波银行，它们都是城市商业银行。2023年修改评估办法以后，城市商业银行还是第一次进入核心成员名单。",
      "en": "The three new ones are Bank of Shanghai, Bank of Hangzhou and Bank of Ningbo, all of which are city commercial banks. Since the evaluation method was revised in 2023, this is the first time city commercial banks have entered the core member list."
    },
    {
      "zh": "成员分为核心、基础和观察三类。今年基础成员有1459家，比去年少了77家。观察成员有227家，比去年少了86家。",
      "en": "Members are divided into three types: core, basic and observer. This year there are 1,459 basic members, 77 fewer than last year. There are 227 observer members, 86 fewer than last year."
    },
    {
      "zh": "评估一共看金融约束、定价能力、定价行为和定价影响力四个方面。如果存款利率调整得比目标少，最多会被扣20分。",
      "en": "The evaluation looks at four areas in total: financial constraints, pricing ability, pricing behavior and pricing influence. If a bank adjusts its deposit rates by less than the target, up to 20 points can be deducted."
    }
  ],
  "source": {
